advanced_rag_answer:
Under Article E3, the following costs are excluded from Relevant Costs: 
1. All costs Directly Attributable to Marketing Activities;
2. Costs related to Heritage Asset Activities;
3. All Finance Costs;
4. All Corporate Income Tax;
5. Costs related to Non-Power Unit Activities;
6. All costs Directly Attributable to Human Resources, Finance, or Legal Activities;
7. All Property Costs;
8. Employee Bonus Costs (subject to a maximum);
9. Registration and administration fees to the FIA;
10. Financial Penalties for breaches of regulations;
11. Depreciation and impairment losses related to excluded activities;
12. Foreign exchange gains and losses;
13. Mandatory employer’s social security contributions;
14. Health And Safety Costs;
15. Costs related to Customer Team Power Unit Activities;
16. Employee Termination Benefits;
17. Travel and accommodation costs for Personnel related to Competitions or Testing;
18. Entertainment costs for employees (subject to a maximum);
19. Sustainability Initiative Costs;
20. Power Unit Transportation Costs;
21. Costs related to the Highest Paid Person;
22. Costs for maternity, paternity, shared parental, or adoption leave;
23. Costs for employees on indefinite sick leave or disability leave;
24. Catering service costs at Competitions or Testing sites.
